              <span class="settings-help-popover">To (test): digits + country code (e.g. 15551234567). Sender: up to 11 letters/numbers. If the test reports sent but no text arrives, check Brevo → Campaigns → SMS or Statistics for delivery status.</span>
            </span>
            <div style="margin-top:.5rem;">
              <button type="button" class="btn" id="smsBrevoDeliveryBtn">Check delivery status (Brevo)</button>
              <span class="settings-help-tip" style="margin-left:0.35rem;">
                <button type="button" class="settings-help-btn" aria-label="Help" aria-expanded="false">?</button>
