              <p class="settings-help" data-acds-hint style="display:none;margin:.35rem 0 0;">To use this feature, you must enable auto creation for groups / channels.</p>
              <div class="settings-auto-create-body" data-acds-body>
                <div class="grid2">
                  <label class="settings-field">
                    <span class="settings-label"><span>Mission Title</span></span>
                    <input type="text" data-acds-title placeholder="Active Incident" />
                  </label>
                  <label class="settings-field">
                    <span class="settings-label"><span>Link to Auto Create Group / Channel</span></span>
